<title>ITALY: ALPINE SKIING-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP WOMEN'S COMBINED RESULTS.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP WOMEN'S COMBINED RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>SESTRIERE, Italy 1997-02-15</dateline>
<text>
